{"id":"n60621-1-10","stage":1,"title":"프로그램 · 目录","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60621-1-10-1","ko":"프로그램은 다 나왔지?","zh":"日程表已经出来了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"프로그램은","meaning":"目录，计划，方案","explanation":"프로그램：目录，计划，方案；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"프로그램","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60621","senseId":"1","lemma":"프로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔지?","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f5044b9ba86548c9","term":"프로그램","zh":"目录，计划，方案","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3","entryId":"60621","definition":"写有某个活动的进行计划或顺序的目次；或指其详细的条目。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在书籍、报纸、广播电视等上登载文章、画作或出现某种内容。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/138c27aca61f0dc1ec63.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60621-1-10-2","ko":"연설자 한 분이 못 오실 수 있다고 해서 아직 안 나왔어요.","zh":"有位演讲者可能来不了，所以还没出。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연설자","meaning":"演讲者","explanation":"연설자：演讲者","readings":[{"term":"연설자","audio":"/audio/83c9bc7eba50605ab8d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:연설자:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"연설자","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분이","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오실","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있다고","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔어요.","meaning":"被刊登，被播放，被记载","explanation":"나오다：被刊登，被播放，被记载；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"4","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"83c9bc7eba50605a","term":"연설자","zh":"演讲者","audio":"/audio/83c9bc7eba50605ab8d4.mp3","definition":"发表演讲的人。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"038a8038eb8